@code{gascity-rig-dashboard-mode}.  A rig is one repository inside a
city that owns its own store and agent pool (@pxref{Terminology}).  It is the single-rig counterpart to
the cockpit, with five independently-loaded sections so that a slow
or failing one never blanks the rest.

@shot{rig-dashboard-dark, The rig dashboard (ef-deuteranopia-dark)}

@section What it shows

@table @asis
@item Header
Rig name, bead-id prefix, branch, suspended or running, bead-store
