@node Cities and Remote Cities
@chapter Cities and Remote Cities
@cindex cities
@fnindex gascity-cities
@kindex j c

@kbd{j c} (or @kbd{M-x gascity-cities}) lists every @dfn{city} gascity
can reach, one row each, in @file{*gascity-cities*}; a city runs on a
@dfn{host}, reached directly or over TRAMP (@pxref{Terminology}):

@example
 City               Where                              Agents Runs Mail Health
 ● bright-lights    ~/bright-lights/                   2/4         ▲4   ●
 ● emacs-city       ~/emacs-city/                      1/5    1 ⬣  ▲5   ▲
