@end quotation

@node Read Mail
@section Read Mail

@kbd{j m} opens the city's inbox.  @key{RET} previews a message in its
thread from data already loaded --- no @command{gc} call, and it stays
unread --- while @kbd{r} reads the thread and marks it read, @kbd{R}
replies, @kbd{a} archives, @kbd{u} marks unread and @kbd{c} opens the
mail actions menu.  @xref{Mail}.

A reply or a new message opens a compose buffer: write the body,
@kbd{C-c C-c} sends, @kbd{C-c C-k} cancels, @kbd{C-c C-n} toggles
@option{--notify}.  The @strong{Mail} list is the same inbox in
tabulated-list form (@pxref{The Mail list}).  Agents prefer ephemeral nudges to
mail for routine signalling (@pxref{Actions}).

