@node View and Key Reference
@chapter View and Key Reference
@cindex view reference
@cindex key reference
@cindex verb reference

This chapter is the exhaustive reference for the surface the manual is
required to cover (REQ-012).  It names every registered view, its mode
map, and every agent action verb with the Emacs command it runs; the
universal keys themselves are described once in @ref{Buffers and
Navigation}.  @code{lisp/test/gascity-manual-test.el} checks that every
name below still appears here, so a new view or verb cannot ship
undocumented.

@section Registered views

@cindex views, registered
Every gascity view is read-only and keyboard-driven.  A @dfn{namespaced}
view may also hold a bead, so its agent verbs live under the @kbd{a}
prefix; an @dfn{agent-only} view keeps the bare single-letter aliases,
and a @dfn{mixed} view shows agents but no beads, so it keeps the bare
aliases too.

@table @asis
@item @code{cockpit} --- @code{gascity-dashboard-mode-map}
@cindex cockpit view
The city triage buffer: vui sections over one @dfn{city}'s state
(@pxref{The Cockpit}, @pxref{Terminology}).  Mixed; agent verbs keep
their bare keys.
@item @code{rig-dashboard} --- @code{gascity-rig-dashboard-mode-map}
@cindex rig dashboard view
One rig's beads, agents and convoys (@pxref{The Rig Dashboard}).
Namespaced: agent verbs are under @kbd{a}.
@item @code{agent-detail} --- @code{gascity-session-detail-mode-map}
@cindex agent detail view
One agent's detail (@pxref{Agents}).  Namespaced.
@item @code{agents-tree} --- @code{gascity-agents-tree-mode-map}
@cindex agents tree view
The hierarchical agent tree (@pxref{Agents}).  Mixed.
@item @code{agents} --- @code{gascity-agents-mode-map}
@cindex agents view
The flat agent table (@pxref{Agents}).  Mixed.
@item @code{session-list} --- @code{gascity-session-list-mode-map}
@cindex session list view
The session list (@pxref{Sessions}).  Mixed.
@item @code{runs} --- @code{gascity-runs-mode-map}
@cindex runs view
Workflow runs (@pxref{Runs and Live Events}).
@item @code{run-detail} --- @code{gascity-run-mode-map}
@cindex run detail view
One run's step ladder (@pxref{Runs and Live Events}).
@item @code{health} --- @code{gascity-health-mode-map}
@cindex health view
Supervisor, versions, stores and doctor (@pxref{Health Costs and the Lighter}).
@item @code{cities} --- @code{gascity-cities-mode-map}
@cindex cities view
Every city on every host (@pxref{Cities and Remote Cities}).
@item @code{rig-list} --- @code{gascity-rig-list-mode-map}
@cindex rig list view
The tabulated rig list (@pxref{Rigs}).
@item @code{convoy-list} --- @code{gascity-convoy-list-mode-map}
@cindex convoy list view
Convoys (@pxref{Convoys}).
@item @code{order-list} --- @code{gascity-order-list-mode-map}
@cindex order list view
Orders (@pxref{Orders}).
@item @code{dolt-list} --- @code{gascity-dolt-list-mode-map}
@cindex dolt list view
The Dolt stores (@pxref{Dolt}).
@item @code{events} --- @code{gascity-events-mode-map}
@cindex events view
The event log (@pxref{Events}).
@item @code{mail-inbox} --- @code{gascity-mail-inbox-mode-map}
@cindex mail inbox view
The mail inbox (@pxref{Mail}).
@item @code{mail-thread} --- @code{gascity-mail-thread-mode-map}
@cindex mail thread view
One mail thread; a text view, not tabulated or vui
(@pxref{Mail}).
@end table

@section Agent action verbs

@cindex agent verbs
Each verb below acts on the agent or session at point.  It is reachable
under @kbd{a} in the namespaced views and on the bare key shown in the
agent-only views (@pxref{Actions}); the dispatcher also exposes it by
prompt (@pxref{The ? dispatch}).

@table @asis
@item Nudge --- @code{gascity-session-nudge-at-point}
@fnindex gascity-session-nudge-at-point
Prompt for a message and send it to the agent: @kbd{a n}, or @kbd{M}
in the agent-only views.
@item Suspend --- @code{gascity-dashboard-suspend}
@fnindex gascity-dashboard-suspend
Suspend the session (the namespaced @kbd{a s}), or the equivalent
@code{gascity-session-suspend-at-point} on the bare @kbd{s} of an
agent-only view.
@item Wake --- @code{gascity-session-wake-at-point}
@fnindex gascity-session-wake-at-point
Wake a suspended agent: @kbd{a w} or @kbd{w}.
@item Kill --- @code{gascity-session-kill-at-point}
@fnindex gascity-session-kill-at-point
Force-kill the agent's runtime: @kbd{a k} or @kbd{K}.  Confirms first.
@item Drain --- @code{gascity-session-drain-at-point}
@fnindex gascity-session-drain-at-point
Wind the agent down gracefully: @kbd{a D} or @kbd{D}.
@item Reset --- @code{gascity-dashboard-reset}
@fnindex gascity-dashboard-reset
Restart the agent's session fresh: @kbd{a r}, or @kbd{R} on an
agent-only view through @code{gascity-session-reset-at-point}.  Confirms
first.
@item Undrain --- @code{gascity-session-undrain-at-point}
@fnindex gascity-session-undrain-at-point
Cancel a drain: @kbd{a u} or @kbd{U}.
@item Attach --- @code{gascity-tmux-at-point}
@fnindex gascity-tmux-at-point
Attach a terminal to the agent's tmux session: @kbd{a t} or @kbd{t}
(@pxref{Attach to a Terminal}).
@item Dired --- @code{gascity-dired-at-point}
@fnindex gascity-dired-at-point
Open the agent's working directory in Dired: @kbd{a d} or @kbd{d}.
@item Detail --- @code{gascity-polecat-detail-at-point}
@fnindex gascity-polecat-detail-at-point
Open the polecat detail view: @kbd{a i} or @kbd{i}.
@item Peek --- @code{gascity-session-peek-at-point}
@fnindex gascity-session-peek-at-point
Show recent terminal output read-only: @kbd{a v} or @kbd{v}.
@end table

