@node Key Reference
@section Universal keys
@cindex key reference
@cindex universal keys

Every view binds the same navigation contract, so these commands are the
reference for the contract keys @kbd{q}, @kbd{g}, @kbd{?}, @kbd{j},
@key{TAB}, @kbd{S-@key{TAB}}, @key{SPC} and @key{RET}, and for the vui
movement keys @kbd{n}, @kbd{p}, @kbd{N} and @kbd{P}.  The two
@dfn{view-specific} contract keys, @kbd{g} and @key{RET}, run the
current view's own refresh and activate command --- for the cockpit,
@code{gascity-dashboard-refresh} and @code{gascity-dashboard-activate}
--- and @ref{Effective Key Bindings} names both per view.  The task
chapter is @ref{Buffers and Navigation}.

@deffn {Command} next-line
@fnindex next-line
@kindex n
Move point down one line (@pxref{Moving and toggling}).
@end deffn

@deffn {Command} previous-line
@fnindex previous-line
@kindex p
Move point up one line.
@end deffn

@deffn {Command} gascity-section-next
@fnindex gascity-section-next
@kindex N
Move point to the next top-level section header, the coarse
counterpart to @kbd{n} (@pxref{The Cockpit}).
@end deffn

@deffn {Command} gascity-section-previous
@fnindex gascity-section-previous
@kindex P
Move point to the previous top-level section header.
@end deffn

@deffn {Command} gascity-thing-forward
@fnindex gascity-thing-forward
