@node Command Reference
@section Commands
@cindex command reference
@cindex registered commands
@cindex gascity-command

Every concrete @code{gascity-command} class is listed here, in the same
alphabetical order as @ref{Generated Command Reference}, which is the
generated, drift-gated copy of the same registry.  A class is the typed
Emacs model of one @command{gc} subcommand: its slots declare that
subcommand's positional arguments and options, and its @code{NAME!}
function executes it and returns the parsed payload.  The task chapters
introduce the porcelain views and keys that drive these classes;
@ref{Generated Command Reference} carries each derived @command{gc}
subcommand and the first line of the class docstring.

